                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7ac0a37b-9814-3a56-967f-1761b8db2545",
                        "entry_id": "9d7efbe7-9a24-35d6-bf42-fc5de01641e1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to tear apart/asunder, to tear up"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "03052469-9b1a-45bc-bd07-323e55876977",
                                "sense_id": "7ac0a37b-9814-3a56-967f-1761b8db2545",
                                "text": "— Не может быть! — сказала Лизавета Ивановна, испугавшись и поспешности требований, и способу, им употреблённому. — Это писано верно не ко мне! — И разорвала письмо в мелкие кусочки.\n— Коли письмо не к вам, зачем же вы его разорвали? — сказала мамзель: — я бы возвратила его тому, кто его послал.",
                                "translation": "\"It cannot be,\" she cried, alarmed at the audacious request, and the manner in which it was made. \"This letter is certainly not for me.\"\nAnd she tore it into fragments.\n\"If the letter was not for you, why have you torn it up?\" said the girl. \"I should have given it back to the person who sent it.\"",
                                "english": "\"It cannot be,\" she cried, alarmed at the audacious request, and the manner in which it was made. \"This letter is certainly not for me.\"\nAnd she tore it into fragments.\n\"If the letter was not for you, why have you torn it up?\" said the girl. \"I should have given it back to the person who sent it.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
